<title>USA: Fedex to use QUALCOMM truck system.</title>
<headline>Fedex to use QUALCOMM truck system.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qualcomm Inc on Monday said Federal Express Corp has signed a contract to purchase Qualcomm's OmniTRACS mobile communications units and has already begun installation of the system.</p>
<p>The installation is set to be completed by May 31st.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The OmniTRACS system is a geostationary satellite-based, mobile communications system providing two-way data and position reporting services.</p>
<p>Federal Express will also implement Qualcomm's SensorTRACS driver performance monitoring system, Qualcomm said.</p>
</text>
